                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This is a delicious brunch spot, my second visit! The food is unique and very tasty. The owner prepares the ingredients with care, and the dishes are thoughtfully designed.\n\nI especially liked the meat and egg toast and the milk tea—they\u0027re quite different from other breakfast places.\n\nThe owners are young and easy to talk to, with great service, making for a very comfortable dining experience. 😌",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "好吃的早午餐店，二訪了～\n餐點很特別，很好吃。老闆用心準備食材，餐點也很有巧思。\n喜歡肉蛋吐司、奶茶～跟別家早餐店很不一樣。\n老闆和老闆娘很年輕好聊，態度很好，用餐很舒服😌",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "yu-jien chen",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102347942854576765668/reviews",
