                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25abmFUVlVlVE5zZVZodFZVUjFSRXQwVFhkVk9FRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab000cd1d837:0x48a1cca6d454da74"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJN9jRDACrQjQRdNpU1KbMoUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GRlNrZE1UVTVXVUZwTFZqTjNSRkZXYWtKWk4zYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "It\u0027s a seemingly unremarkable shop, but the owners are very welcoming. The ingredients are quite good; the broth for the pot-roasted noodles is light and doesn\u0027t taste like it\u0027s made with MSG or chicken powder. You can try adding satay sauce and a little chili powder halfway through for a different flavor. The toast is toasted to a perfect crisp.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "一間看似不明顯的店，老闆跟老闆娘都很熱情招待，吃起來食材滿不錯的，鍋燒麵的湯清淡，喝起來不是味精雞粉調出來的，可以吃一半嘗試加沙茶跟一點辣粉有不同風味，吐司烤的滿剛好的酥脆，",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
